1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,130
If this fungus gets inside an ANT…

2
00:00:02,170 --> 00:00:04,030
it can turn it into a ZOMBIE.

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,105
You see, it spreads

4
00:00:05,145 --> 00:00:06,310
through the ant’s body…

5
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:08,190
and starts controlling its MUSCLES.

6
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:09,495
Then it forces the ant

7
00:00:09,535 --> 00:00:10,690
to CLIMB a plant…

8
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:11,985
and bite down so hard

9
00:00:12,025 --> 00:00:13,320
it can’t let GO.

10
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,820
The ant DIES…

11
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:17,050
but the fungus is just getting STARTED.

12
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,670
Because over the next few days,

13
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:19,960
a giant stalk grows

14
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,320
straight out of its HEAD.

15
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,780
And when it finally opens…

16
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,840
it releases spores

17
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,290
onto the ants BELOW.

18
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:26,910
And beneath that one leaf…

19
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,365
there could be dozens more ants

20
00:00:28,405 --> 00:00:30,460
that died the exact same way.

